 chaosx.nr24.31.t: "Field Validation Report"
-chaosx.nr24.31.d: "The field party has returned with a report that separates the cabinet's useful observations from its tidy assumptions. Its pages divide the findings in three: some can be retained, some require a narrower office, and some should not be allowed near a marching order."
+chaosx.nr24.31.d: "The field party has compared the cabinet's forecasts with roads, supply columns, and divisional exercises. Its officers found which assumptions held, which need correction, and which failed under field conditions."
 chaosx.nr24.31.a: "The field report is accepted."
-chaosx.nr24.31.b: "File the errors for correction."
+chaosx.nr24.31.b: "Correct the faults found in the field."
 chaosx.nr24.31.c: "Close the exercise as inconclusive."
 video_game_field_report_full_tt: "Simulation Reliance has fallen by §G-[?constant:video_game_in_sweden_reliance.field_validation_loss|0]§!. Army training is §G[?constant:video_game_in_sweden_package.field_training|%0]§! faster for [?constant:video_game_in_sweden_timing.field_training_days|0] days, the field-tested supply and enemy assumptions no longer produce mismatch reports, and any §YRulebook Commander§! has been corrected."
 video_game_field_report_partial_tt: "Simulation Reliance has fallen by §G-[?constant:video_game_in_sweden_award.partial_field_validation_loss|0]§!. Reviewed findings quiet the matching mismatch reports, and a targeted follow-up review is available."
 video_game_field_report_failed_tt: "Simulation Reliance has fallen by §G-[?constant:video_game_in_sweden_award.failed_field_validation_gain|0]§!. §YUnresolved Field Findings§! slow planning and reinforcement for [?constant:video_game_in_sweden_timing.field_validation_failure_penalty_days|0] days. A targeted follow-up review is available, and a later official restriction costs [?constant:video_game_in_sweden_effect.restriction_failure_fee_factor|%0] of its usual price."
 
 chaosx.nr24.32.t: "Reality Audit Report"
-chaosx.nr24.32.d: "The audit could not hold its field package together long enough to answer the cabinet. Its parties have been recalled from their regions, and the senior offices have gone back to the old tables with a long list of findings that nobody was able to test."
-chaosx.nr24.32.full_d: "The audit parties have returned from the southern plains, the garrisons around Stockholm and the northern forests with every figure checked against roads, depots and weather. Red pencil marks now cover each place where the cabinet assumed a railway that was not there, and the staff colleges will teach the corrected method as one instrument among several."
-chaosx.nr24.32.partial_d: "The audit parties have returned with most of their comparisons complete. Gaps remain where a region slipped out of the field package, a store ran short or an independent review was never filed, so the Ministry will keep a provisional comparison staff beside the cabinet until a narrower reassessment finishes the work."
+chaosx.nr24.32.narrow_t: "Swedish Forecasts Reassessed"
+chaosx.nr24.32.narrow_full_d: "The smaller field party has compared the disputed forecasts with roads, stores, and troop movements. The corrected exercises can remain in Swedish training without directing military orders."
+chaosx.nr24.32.narrow_partial_d: "The smaller party checked several disputed forecasts, but interruptions in supplies or troop movements left others untested. The comparison staff will continue under provisional orders until the government settles the cabinet's future."
+chaosx.nr24.32.narrow_failed_d: "The smaller party could not keep troops and stores ready long enough to test the disputed forecasts. The army still has no field evidence for those assumptions, and the government must settle the cabinet's future."
+video_game_audit_partial_result_display_tt: "[GetVideoGameAuditPartialResult]"
+video_game_audit_failed_result_display_tt: "[GetVideoGameAuditFailedResult]"
+video_game_narrow_audit_partial_result_tt: "Simulation Reliance has fallen to at most ?Y[?constant:video_game_in_sweden_reliance.doctrine_max|0]?!. ?YIndependent Staff Comparison?! continues for [?constant:video_game_in_sweden_timing.provisional_dual_track_days|0] days. An official restriction remains available."
+video_game_narrow_audit_failed_result_tt: "?YSimulation Orthodoxy?! returns, and ?YUnresolved Field Findings?! slow planning and reinforcement for [?constant:video_game_in_sweden_timing.reality_audit_failure_penalty_days|0] days. An official restriction remains available."
+chaosx.nr24.32.d: "The audit parties could not keep their divisions and stores together long enough to finish the comparison. Sweden's commands still rely on untested forecasts and must choose another way to settle the matter."
+chaosx.nr24.32.full_d: "Field officers have checked the cabinet's forecasts against railway routes, depots, and marching columns. The staff colleges will retain exercises corrected by those observations and keep the cabinet's timetable out of military orders."
+chaosx.nr24.32.partial_d: "The audit parties have returned with most of their comparisons complete. Missing troops, short stores, or an unfinished independent review left some forecasts untested. A provisional comparison staff will remain beside the cabinet while Sweden prepares a narrower reassessment."
 chaosx.nr24.32.a: "Teach the corrected method."
 chaosx.nr24.32.b: "Keep the comparison staff in place."
-chaosx.nr24.32.c: "Record the untested findings."
+chaosx.nr24.32.c: "The tables remain untested."
 video_game_audit_full_result_tt: "Simulation Reliance has fallen to at most §Y[?constant:video_game_in_sweden_reliance.habit_max|0]§!. Any §YRulebook Commander§! has been corrected, and §YValidated Wargaming Methods§! guides Swedish training for [?constant:video_game_in_sweden_timing.validated_methods_days|0] days before the programme closes."
